  "details": "Using the pop-culture reference \"Something 2: Electric Boogaloo\" in a VRC world name results in \"Boogaloo\" being changed to \"Bogeyman\".\n\nIt was actually difficult for me to find out why - extremist American anti-government movements don't feature much internationally - and so I very much doubt anyone would read this other than a whimsical reference to the 1984 breakdancing movie.\n\nCan we NOT let the racists ruin everything nice please?",
